        {
            "title": "New Release - Shift 2 Unleashed",
            "date": "2011-03-29 13:00:00",
            "url": "http://store.steampowered.com/news/5193/",
            "content": " \n<a href=\"http://store.steampowered.com/app/47920/\">Shift 2 Unleashed</a> is now available on Steam in North America and will become available world-wide very soon (please see the Crysis 2 <a href=\"http://store.steampowered.com/app/47920/\">store page</a> for release times).<br><br>SHIFT 2 UNLEASHED delivers all the violence, energy and excitement of race day in a groundbreaking authentic racing experience with an all-new rendering engine and graphics overhaul, innovative helmet camera, night racing, and authentic degradation of tracks and cars.<br><br>Connects  with friends and competitors to race head-to-head and compare player statistic match-ups!<br><br><a href=\"http://store.steampowered.com/app/47920/\"><img src=\"http://storefront.steampowered.com/v/gfx/apps/47920/capsule_467x181.jpg\" style=\" float: left; margin-right: 12px; height: 181px; width: 467px;\"></a>\t\t\t\t"
